		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Fat, black vine-tree sprouting head-shaped fruit. Grow far from civilization, reproducing via fruit-seeds.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 10, <strong>HP</strong> 34, <strong>ATK</strong> 2 branch (near) +5 (1d8) and alluring stench and head fruit, <strong>MV</strong> close, <strong>S</strong> +5, <strong>D</strong> -2, <strong>C</strong> +3, <strong>I</strong> -2, <strong>W</strong> +0, <strong>Ch</strong> +2, <strong>AL</strong> N, <strong>LV</strong> 7</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Alluring Stench</strong>. Creatures within double near, CHA 15+ or dazed and drawn to tree for 1d4 rounds.</p><p></p><p><strong>Head Fruit</strong>. Creatures within close, WIS 15+ or start eating head fruit, 1d6 WIS damage. Repeat check each round, coma at 0 WIS.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
